{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.poster.avif?t=1766414502\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.webm?t=1766414502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.mp4?t=1766414502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mixxpell</strong>! The battle of wizards at the International Wizard Convention. Here, you combine spells and test them out through battle with other wizards for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck of spell cards.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, players get to choose a spell card to upgrade their build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active spells cast magic, and support spells modify the way magic works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix them to create a unique combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be something powerful to overwhelm your opponent or something more creative in a way no one ever expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around unpredictably, use movement spells to dodge or close the distance, and cast a barrier if you have to block a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hit them with your best shot when you see the perfect opening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10,000 spell combinations and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684760?t=1766414502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/3650f9bc4a2bf3d867ffe1f27476227f765582cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766414502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/4d3d450cc6851cc6fab5c7f5c52f2216531f7f58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766414502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/4d3d450cc6851cc6fab5c7f5c52f2216531f7f58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766414502","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.poster.avif?t=1766414502\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.webm?t=1766414502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.mp4?t=1766414502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mixxpell</strong>! The battle of wizards at the International Wizard Convention. Here, you combine spells and test them out through battle with other wizards for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck of spell cards.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, players get to choose a spell card to upgrade their build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active spells cast magic, and support spells modify the way magic works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix them to create a unique combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be something powerful to overwhelm your opponent or something more creative in a way no one ever expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around unpredictably, use movement spells to dodge or close the distance, and cast a barrier if you have to block a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hit them with your best shot when you see the perfect opening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10,000 spell combinations and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Baekgeumdan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/5e570e5288aa9e0735d60e4bf2342fa0ac181cb2/header.jpg?t=1766414502","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3684760/874449/e5d9bfbf